# The files the front-end review pass covers: one repo-relative path per line, `#` and blank lines
# ignored. Same format as `SCOPE`, read by the same substitution (`scripts/audit.sh:226-227`), but a
# separate list because this pass is not the Solidity one: no skill, a web-security prompt
# (`prompts/frontend-leg.md`), and a surface that is loaded by strangers rather than called by a
# chain.
#
# Why this list exists at all. `app/` is excluded from `SCOPE` with a reason that was true when it
# was written — "the dapp was signed off in M02 Phase 5, and a UI change after this review is a
# second review (decision 14)" — and M04 made the document a thing a third party's gateway serves to
# anyone. m04-t04 is that second review.
#
# Named file by file, never a directory glob: a review whose scope is `app/` would silently grow
# every time a file lands there, and the provenance block has to be able to say what was read.
#
# `app/build.mjs` is here, where `SCOPE` excludes it as "build tooling, no authority on chain". That
# reversal is deliberate: its substitutions put values into the document before it is uploaded, so
# the build is an injection point into the surface strangers load. The three modules it imports
# (`app/build.mjs:18-20`) are here for the same reason and no other — `version.mjs` and
# `broadcast.mjs` compute two of those substituted values, and `inline-scripts.mjs` enforces the
# inline, attribute-free script guard that makes the DOMParser swap run the app at all. The injected
# value is what an attacker reaches; reviewing the injection point without its inputs would leave
# that unread.
#
# Excluded, each with the reason the method asks for (`README.md` § Scope), so the next reader does
# not re-derive it:
#
#   app/src/host.html    the dev foil: a local page for driving the widget by hand, loads
#                        `widget.js` relatively and reads `?rpc=`, never uploaded and never served
#                        by the gateway (m04-t04 `TASK.md` step 4)
#   app/src/theme.css    no script, no interpolation; a stylesheet the build inlines verbatim
#   test/                not shipped

app/src/index.html
app/src/model.js
app/src/eth.js
app/src/widget.js
app/src/layout.html
app/build.mjs
app/inline-scripts.mjs
app/broadcast.mjs
app/version.mjs
